1
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:34,979
[AWAKEN]

2
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:37,920
[Episode 2]

3
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:50,229
♪ The east wind wanes,
and the flowers wither ♪

4
00:01:56,430 --> 00:02:01,680
♪ The spring silkworm spins till death ♪

5
00:01:58,900 --> 00:02:02,110
[Zhao Qian, Section Chief
of the General Affairs Division, No. 76]

6
00:02:03,650 --> 00:02:06,740
[Du Huangqiao,
three-stringed instrument player]

7
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:12,590
♪ The candle weeps till it burns to ash ♪

8
00:02:20,710 --> 00:02:22,370
Your string is about to break.

9
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,680
People die.

10
00:02:27,079 --> 00:02:29,540
It's perfectly normal
for a string to break.

11
00:02:42,430 --> 00:02:44,710
Mr. Zhao, leaving in such a hurry?

12
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:48,800
[Yang Xiaoxian, owner of Fairy Bath]

13
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:52,430
Looks like you have a date with a beauty.

14
00:02:52,710 --> 00:02:53,680
What beauty?

15
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:55,710
A tigress from Nanjing.

16
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:59,280
Who says a tigress can't be a beauty?

17
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:03,520
I wonder, once this tigress arrives,

18
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,730
who will suffer.

19
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,080
Whoever it is,

20
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,870
it won't be you, Mr. Zhao.

21
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:11,570
I'm leaving.

22
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,820
Director Li isn't coming?

23
00:03:46,310 --> 00:03:47,310
As the director,

24
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:49,190
he has to put on airs.

25
00:03:52,079 --> 00:03:54,340
Why did Inspector Su come from Hangzhou?

26
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:58,490
The Shanghai-Nanjing railway line
is under repair.

27
00:04:02,030 --> 00:04:04,780
[Cang Guanglian, Captain of Unit 1,
Operations Division, No. 76]

28
00:04:38,860 --> 00:04:40,100
Su Chuanghan.

29
00:04:40,510 --> 00:04:41,710
Chuanghan as in "My window frames the snow
on the Western Mountains,

30
00:04:41,710 --> 00:04:43,240
eternal through the ages."

31
00:04:44,150 --> 00:04:45,010
Remember that.

32
00:04:48,830 --> 00:04:49,600
I'm leaving.

33
00:04:50,630 --> 00:04:51,760
I'm going to France.

34
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:54,360
This Su Men is quite a beauty.

35
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:55,560
Mr. Zhao.

36
00:04:55,830 --> 00:04:57,070
Should we find a way to win over

37
00:04:57,070 --> 00:04:58,830
this inspector from Nanjing?

38
00:04:59,190 --> 00:05:01,050
Captain Cang, you must be joking.

39
00:05:14,760 --> 00:05:15,540
Catch him!

40
00:05:21,190 --> 00:05:21,800
Watch out!

41
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:30,270
After him!

42
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:32,659
Take him alive!

43
00:05:50,830 --> 00:05:52,690
Were you the one yelling just now?

44
00:05:53,390 --> 00:05:54,250
Bring him here.

45
00:05:55,409 --> 00:05:56,670
Why are you arresting him?

46
00:05:56,670 --> 00:05:57,990
Let him go! Let go!

47
00:05:58,240 --> 00:05:59,700
What do you do for a living?

48
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,170
I'm a photographer.

49
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,690
You're his accomplice?

50
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:04,630
I'm not.

51
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,480
Take him back.

52
00:06:05,620 --> 00:06:06,420
Let him go.

53
00:06:08,510 --> 00:06:10,110
Did you hear that? Let him go.

54
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:12,160
Inspector Su, please get in the car.

55
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:17,510
Shanghai is a tough place.

56
00:06:17,510 --> 00:06:18,310
Be careful.

57
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:21,360
Let's go.

58
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:22,870
Chen,

59
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,360
do you have a death wish?

60
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:25,760
You almost got me killed.

61
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:27,390
It's broken.

62
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:28,830
Alright.

63
00:06:29,190 --> 00:06:30,990
Out with the old, in with the new.

64
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:33,070
Don't just take pictures of anything.

65
00:06:33,070 --> 00:06:34,130
Let's go. Hurry up.

66
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:40,800
Inspector Su, here's what we've got.

67
00:06:42,270 --> 00:06:44,120
We're still chasing the one who ran away.

68
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,920
The one we caught has confessed.

69
00:06:46,390 --> 00:06:47,800
He was sent by Chongqing.

70
00:06:51,510 --> 00:06:52,120
Is that so?

71
00:06:54,510 --> 00:06:55,870
I don't quite believe it either.

72
00:06:55,870 --> 00:06:57,630
Why don't you go back and rest first?

73
00:06:57,630 --> 00:07:00,560
I will take him back
for interrogation immediately.

74
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:01,360
No need.

75
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,970
I will interrogate him myself.

76
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:07,630
You must be exhausted from the journey.

77
00:07:07,630 --> 00:07:08,850
Besides, the municipal government office

78
00:07:08,850 --> 00:07:10,600
doesn't have the facilities
for interrogation.

79
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:12,480
This is a matter for No. 76.

80
00:07:13,750 --> 00:07:15,750
Then I'll interrogate him at No. 76.

81
00:07:15,830 --> 00:07:16,310
Well...

82
00:07:16,430 --> 00:07:19,040
This... this is against protocol.

83
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:22,530
I must ask Director Li Moqun
for instructions first.

84
00:07:22,950 --> 00:07:25,150
I will ask for his instructions myself.

85
00:07:28,190 --> 00:07:29,120
Go to No. 76.

86
00:07:47,770 --> 00:07:51,130
[Li Moqun, Director of No. 76]

87
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:08,500
Director Li is waiting for you
in his office.

88
00:08:08,510 --> 00:08:10,430
Tell him to meet me
in the interrogation room.

89
00:08:10,430 --> 00:08:11,070
But...

90
00:08:33,150 --> 00:08:34,360
Tie the prisoner to the chair.

91
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:34,870
Yes.

92
00:08:43,140 --> 00:08:43,940
Inspector Su.

93
00:08:43,970 --> 00:08:45,720
It's too dirty and messy here for you.

94
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,200
Let me interrogate him, alright?

95
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:48,260
Go make a pot of tea.

96
00:08:48,510 --> 00:08:49,570
Go make a pot of tea.

97
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,120
You go.

98
00:08:56,780 --> 00:08:58,840
All unauthorized personnel, leave.

99
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:28,840
I know it wasn't the Hurricane Team.

100
00:09:30,630 --> 00:09:32,090
Your life is of no use to me.

101
00:09:33,390 --> 00:09:34,250
Tell the truth,

102
00:09:34,870 --> 00:09:35,960
and I can let you go.

103
00:09:37,910 --> 00:09:41,360
I'll die whether I speak or not.

104
00:09:46,390 --> 00:09:47,600
Who poisoned you?

105
00:09:55,510 --> 00:09:56,240
He's dead.

106
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,640
Inspector Su.

107
00:10:19,150 --> 00:10:20,440
I'm terribly sorry.

108
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:21,910
I'm late.

109
00:10:24,270 --> 00:10:25,200
Where is the tea?

110
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:31,730
This is this year's new tea.

111
00:10:43,510 --> 00:10:44,910
Are you trying to kill me?

112
00:10:48,030 --> 00:10:49,200
I'd like to,

113
00:10:50,150 --> 00:10:51,880
but someone was faster than me.

114
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:56,000
The assassin was killed
right after being caught.

115
00:10:56,790 --> 00:10:57,550
Director Li,

116
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:02,410
your people at No. 76
are certainly a talented bunch.

117
00:11:03,550 --> 00:11:04,540
Inspector Su,

118
00:11:04,870 --> 00:11:07,070
there's a hidden meaning in your words.

119
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:10,630
Good that you know.

120
00:11:12,670 --> 00:11:15,550
Nanjing sent me to Shanghai
to investigate corruption.

121
00:11:15,550 --> 00:11:16,870
Is this how you

122
00:11:17,390 --> 00:11:18,550
welcome me?

123
00:11:20,270 --> 00:11:21,600
Please calm your anger, Inspector Su.

124
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:22,870
It must be a misunderstanding.

125
00:11:22,870 --> 00:11:24,320
Let's talk in the office.

126
00:11:25,510 --> 00:11:26,390
Merchants getting kidnapped,

127
00:11:26,390 --> 00:11:27,150
rebels running rampant,

128
00:11:27,150 --> 00:11:28,550
and deep public resentment.

129
00:11:28,550 --> 00:11:29,910
The Japanese have issued an ultimatum.

130
00:11:29,910 --> 00:11:31,750
Chairman Wang
couldn't tolerate it anymore.

131
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:34,200
The second the inspector arrived,
someone attempted to assassinate her.

132
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:36,030
And the assassin died
right after being caught.

133
00:11:36,030 --> 00:11:38,360
Everything is connected to No. 76.

134
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,440
Director Li, you owe me an explanation.

135
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:42,040
Don't worry. I will explain.

136
00:11:42,660 --> 00:11:44,260
Hurry up and make a cup of tea.

137
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:45,390
Green tea.

138
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:48,060
Green tea? Really?

139
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:52,780
Please have a seat.

140
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,370
I'm terribly sorry.

141
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:56,630
I was tied up with official business
and couldn't pick you up.

142
00:11:56,630 --> 00:11:58,410
I didn't expect this to happen.

143
00:11:58,910 --> 00:12:00,510
No. 76 failed to protect you.

144
00:12:00,510 --> 00:12:01,750
Captain Cang neglected his duty.

145
00:12:01,750 --> 00:12:02,750
But rest assured.

146
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:06,250
I definitely will
investigate this matter thoroughly.

147
00:12:06,600 --> 00:12:07,790
Can you?

148
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:10,880
Committing suicide by poison upon failure

149
00:12:11,870 --> 00:12:13,800
is the style of the Hurricane Team.

150
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:20,260
Then you'll just let the Hurricane Team
take the blame?

151
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,560
If they don't take it,

152
00:12:21,630 --> 00:12:23,090
we have no other evidence.

153
00:12:28,150 --> 00:12:28,910
That's true.

154
00:12:29,910 --> 00:12:32,000
Of all the mysterious deaths in No. 76,

155
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:33,260
his is not the only one.

156
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,440
Go! Hurry!

157
00:13:02,920 --> 00:13:05,050
What are you doing? What are you doing?

158
00:13:05,150 --> 00:13:05,720
Go!

159
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:11,930
This matter has already reached Nanjing.

160
00:13:14,630 --> 00:13:16,150
You people at No. 76

161
00:13:17,240 --> 00:13:19,170
can't catch rebels and assassins,

162
00:13:21,030 --> 00:13:22,840
but when it comes to
extorting businessmen,

163
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:24,440
you have all sorts of tricks.

164
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:28,910
Inspector Su.

165
00:13:29,870 --> 00:13:31,130
There are some things,

166
00:13:31,390 --> 00:13:33,200
since you just arrived in Shanghai,

167
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:34,320
that you don't know.

168
00:13:34,320 --> 00:13:37,120
Then please take the trouble
to explain them to me.

169
00:13:41,440 --> 00:13:42,570
At the end of the day,

170
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:45,000
we all work for the Japanese.

171
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:50,120
I know.

172
00:13:51,670 --> 00:13:52,750
The Japanese don't like

173
00:13:52,750 --> 00:13:55,480
so-called patriotic businessmen
like Mr. Fang.

174
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:59,360
But you shouldn't have just framed him

175
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:01,020
and done whatever you wanted.

176
00:14:01,270 --> 00:14:03,750
Even the tabloids got hold of it

177
00:14:03,750 --> 00:14:05,610
and are spreading rumors wildly.

178
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:11,790
You take so much funding every year,

179
00:14:12,670 --> 00:14:14,750
yet you've made a mess of Shanghai.

180
00:14:16,270 --> 00:14:17,080
Director Li.

181
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:21,290
Is this your explanation to the Japanese?

182
00:14:28,910 --> 00:14:29,890
Inspector Su,

183
00:14:31,120 --> 00:14:33,320
are you forcing me to resign?

184
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:40,000
Whether you can keep this position

185
00:14:41,720 --> 00:14:44,250
depends on whether
you've touched the money.

186
00:14:50,390 --> 00:14:52,720
Inspector Su, you must understand.

187
00:14:53,790 --> 00:14:55,720
The primary task of No. 76

188
00:14:55,960 --> 00:14:57,080
is to catch rebels.

189
00:14:58,150 --> 00:15:00,240
A Japanese official died in Hangzhou,

190
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:02,630
and he was carrying
important intelligence.

191
00:15:02,630 --> 00:15:04,870
General Kagesa gave me a strict order

192
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:06,550
that this matter

193
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:08,890
must be investigated thoroughly.

194
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:11,880
I have so many things on my plate.

195
00:15:12,030 --> 00:15:14,690
How could I have time
for these trivial matters?

196
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:16,730
Director Li.

197
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:19,800
How do you think his whereabouts

198
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:21,320
were exposed?

199
00:15:29,580 --> 00:15:30,640
This intelligence

200
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:34,600
was leaked from No. 76.

201
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:38,510
For money, some people

202
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:40,910
have no bottom line.

203
00:15:45,390 --> 00:15:47,870
I wonder if what you're saying

204
00:15:48,910 --> 00:15:50,570
is supported by any evidence.

205
00:15:55,360 --> 00:15:57,030
Isn't that why I'm here?

206
00:16:00,170 --> 00:16:02,500
But before I even started investigating,

207
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:04,600
someone wanted me dead.

208
00:16:06,550 --> 00:16:08,550
If it really is an internal problem,

209
00:16:08,880 --> 00:16:11,720
I, Li Moqun, will clean house myself

210
00:16:12,670 --> 00:16:14,200
and leave no room for mercy.

211
00:16:23,550 --> 00:16:24,600
I hope so.

212
00:16:39,030 --> 00:16:39,630
Yes.

213
00:16:40,360 --> 00:16:41,080
I'm sorry.

214
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:44,720
What's your name?

215
00:16:46,550 --> 00:16:49,630
I'm Cang Guanglian, captain
of Unit 1 of the Operations Division,

216
00:16:49,630 --> 00:16:50,890
directly under No. 76.

217
00:16:51,270 --> 00:16:52,840
That's quite a long title.

218
00:16:52,960 --> 00:16:54,720
Escort Inspector Su back
to the municipal government office.

219
00:16:54,720 --> 00:16:55,270
Yes.

220
00:16:57,390 --> 00:16:58,750
Newspapers!

221
00:16:58,870 --> 00:17:00,440
Newspapers!

222
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:02,270
Newspapers!

223
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:44,880
Here's the money.

224
00:17:45,110 --> 00:17:46,110
Thank you, ma'am.

225
00:17:47,480 --> 00:17:49,080
This is my aunt's territory.

226
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:51,340
She collects locker tokens here.

227
00:17:52,110 --> 00:17:53,030
Fairy Bath?

228
00:17:55,830 --> 00:18:01,000
♪ Rippling waters, cooling breeze ♪

229
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:07,550
How many times have I told you not to cry?

230
00:18:07,550 --> 00:18:09,510
A woman's tears
are the most worthless things.

231
00:18:09,510 --> 00:18:11,110
Shen Fengxi was beaten by Commander Liu,

232
00:18:11,110 --> 00:18:12,000
and all she did was cry.

233
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:14,070
In the end,
she could only go to a mental hospital.

234
00:18:14,070 --> 00:18:15,270
What brings you here?

235
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:18,020
Why didn't you tell me in advance?

236
00:18:18,070 --> 00:18:19,310
I missed you.

237
00:18:20,070 --> 00:18:21,270
And I wanted to try my luck in Shanghai.

238
00:18:21,270 --> 00:18:22,030
Okay.

239
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:23,200
Stay with me.

240
00:18:23,440 --> 00:18:24,920
Stay as long as you want.

241
00:18:25,200 --> 00:18:25,820
Okay.

242
00:18:25,840 --> 00:18:27,500
Come on. I'll show you around.

243
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,030
Don't run around.

244
00:18:31,550 --> 00:18:32,310
Auntie,

245
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:35,030
this man is my lover.

246
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:37,200
Don't talk nonsense.

247
00:18:37,680 --> 00:18:38,920
Come with us.

248
00:19:09,030 --> 00:19:09,690
Inspector.

249
00:19:10,310 --> 00:19:12,550
This is the important evidence
they collected

250
00:19:12,550 --> 00:19:13,640
of officials at all levels in Shanghai
colluding with No. 76

251
00:19:13,640 --> 00:19:15,240
and engaging in corruption.

252
00:19:16,550 --> 00:19:19,410
This includes
buying and selling official titles,

253
00:19:21,720 --> 00:19:22,980
embezzling salaries,

254
00:19:26,350 --> 00:19:28,010
participating in smuggling,

255
00:19:32,590 --> 00:19:34,390
and even killing people at will.

256
00:19:54,310 --> 00:19:57,440
These people all have close personal ties
with Li Moqun.

257
00:20:03,790 --> 00:20:05,920
All personnel involved at all levels,

258
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:08,410
regardless of their position,

259
00:20:08,640 --> 00:20:11,100
shall be arrested and await investigation.

260
00:20:11,400 --> 00:20:12,480
Take action tonight.

261
00:20:12,480 --> 00:20:13,200
Yes!

262
00:20:13,750 --> 00:20:14,720
Your fried rice

263
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:17,600
is even better than the one
at the Huamao Hotel.

264
00:20:18,270 --> 00:20:20,880
Your lover is such a sweet talker.

265
00:20:21,350 --> 00:20:22,350
We're not lovers.

266
00:20:22,350 --> 00:20:23,350
We are neighbors.

267
00:20:23,440 --> 00:20:24,570
I'm a photographer.

268
00:20:26,030 --> 00:20:27,750
Then can you
take a few pictures of me sometime?

269
00:20:27,750 --> 00:20:28,720
Once this camera is fixed,

270
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:31,050
you'll be the first one
I take pictures of.

271
00:20:31,270 --> 00:20:32,350
Right, Auntie.

272
00:20:32,830 --> 00:20:34,560
Is there a photo studio nearby?

273
00:20:35,160 --> 00:20:36,160
There's one right across the street.

274
00:20:36,160 --> 00:20:36,920
If you want to go, hurry up.

275
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:37,980
It's closing soon.

276
00:20:44,420 --> 00:20:45,510
Sir! Sir! Sir!

277
00:20:45,590 --> 00:20:46,160
Sir!

278
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:47,310
Sir!

279
00:20:49,790 --> 00:20:50,830
We're closed.

280
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:52,880
Do you want to take photos
or have them developed?

281
00:20:52,880 --> 00:20:54,680
I want to borrow your darkroom.

282
00:20:54,680 --> 00:20:55,790
I'll develop them myself.

283
00:20:55,790 --> 00:20:56,310
Well...

284
00:20:56,310 --> 00:20:57,200
I'll pay.

285
00:20:58,930 --> 00:20:59,860
Alright, come in.

286
00:20:59,860 --> 00:21:01,060
Thank you. Thank you.

287
00:21:01,950 --> 00:21:03,410
The darkroom is over here.

288
00:21:08,080 --> 00:21:10,000
Is there really nothing between you

289
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:11,660
and that young man named Chen?

290
00:21:11,710 --> 00:21:12,920
He's so dull.

291
00:21:12,940 --> 00:21:14,400
I'm not interested in him.

292
00:21:14,880 --> 00:21:16,110
Then why do you go around telling everyone

293
00:21:16,110 --> 00:21:17,550
he's your lover?

294
00:21:18,400 --> 00:21:19,880
I just like teasing him.

295
00:21:20,800 --> 00:21:21,830
If there's nothing between you,

296
00:21:21,830 --> 00:21:23,630
would you have brought him here?

297
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:25,130
He had nowhere to go.

298
00:21:27,350 --> 00:21:30,280
You never used to meddle
in other people's business.

299
00:21:32,960 --> 00:21:33,620
In the past,

300
00:21:34,160 --> 00:21:35,890
he also meddled in my business.

301
00:21:44,070 --> 00:21:44,640
Meizhen.

302
00:21:46,200 --> 00:21:46,960
Be careful.

303
00:21:49,240 --> 00:21:50,310
Wait for me, Meizhen.

304
00:21:50,310 --> 00:21:51,270
Let go of me.

305
00:21:51,270 --> 00:21:52,400
Where are you going? Wait for me.

306
00:21:52,400 --> 00:21:53,000
Let go of me.

307
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:54,200
Meizhen. Meizhen.

308
00:21:54,510 --> 00:21:55,640
Meizhen! Mei...

309
00:21:55,920 --> 00:21:57,240
You're so annoying.

310
00:21:57,480 --> 00:21:59,110
There is no time like the present.

311
00:21:59,110 --> 00:22:00,510
Let's do it today.

312
00:22:00,830 --> 00:22:01,510
Go away!

313
00:22:01,790 --> 00:22:02,350
Meizhen.

314
00:22:02,350 --> 00:22:03,400
Go away!

315
00:22:03,400 --> 00:22:04,550
Run!

316
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:06,680
The police are catching perverts!

317
00:22:06,680 --> 00:22:08,030
They're shooting!

318
00:22:08,400 --> 00:22:09,930
Run!

319
00:22:10,640 --> 00:22:11,480
Hurry!

320
00:22:19,400 --> 00:22:20,270
Meizhen!

321
00:22:22,200 --> 00:22:22,880
Zhen!

322
00:22:30,110 --> 00:22:30,750
Go home.

323
00:22:33,720 --> 00:22:34,270
Let's go.

324
00:22:42,400 --> 00:22:43,200
They're gone.

325
00:22:53,880 --> 00:22:54,590
I was

326
00:22:55,750 --> 00:22:57,590
afraid he would come to our photo studio
to make trouble

327
00:22:57,590 --> 00:22:58,920
and ruin my livelihood.

328
00:23:03,680 --> 00:23:07,720
Even if it were someone else
being bullied today,

329
00:23:07,830 --> 00:23:08,890
I would still help.

330
00:23:10,030 --> 00:23:10,830
Since I saw it,

331
00:23:10,830 --> 00:23:12,030
I had to help.

332
00:23:15,790 --> 00:23:16,440
Thanks.

333
00:23:17,030 --> 00:23:17,960
You're welcome.

334
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:20,800
As your auntie,
I approve of this marriage.

335
00:23:21,270 --> 00:23:22,550
Who wants to marry him?

336
00:23:23,000 --> 00:23:24,600
I'm in no rush to get married.

337
00:23:26,550 --> 00:23:28,480
Find someone who cares for you,

338
00:23:28,920 --> 00:23:30,240
have a boy and a girl,

339
00:23:30,550 --> 00:23:32,150
and live happily ever after.

340
00:23:32,150 --> 00:23:33,640
How wonderful would that be?

341
00:23:33,640 --> 00:23:35,400
I came to Shanghai to try my luck.

342
00:23:35,400 --> 00:23:36,550
If I don't achieve something big,

343
00:23:36,550 --> 00:23:38,150
wouldn't it be a wasted trip?

344
00:23:38,270 --> 00:23:39,730
Then what do you want to do?

345
00:23:40,920 --> 00:23:42,980
To be the ballroom queen of Shanghai.

346
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:44,480
What?

347
00:23:46,270 --> 00:23:48,920
What is the best dance hall
in Shanghai called?

348
00:23:48,920 --> 00:23:49,750
MGM.

349
00:23:50,000 --> 00:23:50,830
Just watch.

350
00:23:51,720 --> 00:23:53,400
The ballroom queen of MGM

351
00:23:53,750 --> 00:23:55,210
will be none other than me.

352
00:24:12,640 --> 00:24:15,570
Why do you need
a magnifying glass to develop photos?

353
00:24:15,680 --> 00:24:17,080
I'm getting presbyopic.

354
00:24:36,440 --> 00:24:38,200
Go to Shanghai

355
00:24:38,720 --> 00:24:41,510
and open Fulai Photo Studio.

356
00:24:48,550 --> 00:24:50,810
Sir, would you like a pack of cigarettes?

357
00:24:52,030 --> 00:24:53,230
Send it to Chongqing.

358
00:25:14,070 --> 00:25:16,130
We interrogated them all overnight.

359
00:25:18,310 --> 00:25:20,310
They all confessed to their crimes.

360
00:25:20,720 --> 00:25:22,050
But without exception,

361
00:25:22,110 --> 00:25:24,840
they all denied
having anything to do with No. 76.

362
00:25:27,010 --> 00:25:28,490
I never expected

363
00:25:28,550 --> 00:25:30,550
to bring Li Moqun down through them.

364
00:25:33,510 --> 00:25:35,200
To find evidence against him,

365
00:25:36,350 --> 00:25:38,440
this is not enough.

366
00:25:39,750 --> 00:25:40,880
Then what do we need?

367
00:25:45,640 --> 00:25:46,240
Come in.

368
00:25:49,680 --> 00:25:50,310
Director,

369
00:25:50,830 --> 00:25:51,760
Chief Yu is here.

370
00:25:53,340 --> 00:25:54,690
[Yu Yingxiang, Chief
of General Affairs Division, No. 76]

371
00:25:57,270 --> 00:25:58,470
How dare you dodge it?

372
00:25:59,690 --> 00:26:01,640
Who told you to make a move
at the train station?

373
00:26:01,640 --> 00:26:02,400
It wasn't me.

374
00:26:06,070 --> 00:26:08,400
You couldn't even kill someone properly.

375
00:26:08,720 --> 00:26:10,920
Why weren't you capable of killing her?

376
00:26:12,310 --> 00:26:15,040
It would be better
than leaving evidence behind!

377
00:26:27,400 --> 00:26:29,530
A Japanese official died in Hangzhou.

378
00:26:30,680 --> 00:26:33,010
The news was likely leaked from Shanghai.

379
00:26:35,240 --> 00:26:38,070
Kagesa asked me
to investigate this thoroughly.

380
00:26:39,300 --> 00:26:40,300
Do you think...

381
00:26:40,330 --> 00:26:41,090
Shut up!

382
00:26:46,190 --> 00:26:47,920
How many times have I told you?

383
00:26:49,510 --> 00:26:51,370
What you should and shouldn't do,

384
00:26:51,640 --> 00:26:53,170
you must remember clearly.

385
00:26:57,750 --> 00:27:00,150
Embezzling a little money
is a minor issue,

386
00:27:00,440 --> 00:27:03,040
but colluding with the Communists
and the NBIS

387
00:27:03,440 --> 00:27:04,640
is a real taboo!

388
00:27:06,720 --> 00:27:07,440
Director.

389
00:27:07,790 --> 00:27:09,400
Even if we were bold enough,

390
00:27:09,400 --> 00:27:11,200
we wouldn't dare do such a thing.

391
00:27:18,310 --> 00:27:20,110
I have already given their family members

392
00:27:20,110 --> 00:27:21,240
a heads-up.

393
00:27:24,590 --> 00:27:26,200
But this woman, Su Men,

394
00:27:26,640 --> 00:27:28,310
won't just stop at catching

395
00:27:28,680 --> 00:27:30,080
a few corrupt officials.

396
00:27:35,270 --> 00:27:36,440
This fire

397
00:27:38,110 --> 00:27:40,440
will eventually burn to No. 76.

398
00:27:45,070 --> 00:27:46,670
Go out and lay low for a while.

399
00:27:47,920 --> 00:27:48,590
Get out!

400
00:27:53,960 --> 00:27:54,830
You too!

401
00:28:08,480 --> 00:28:10,480
Only by finding evidence of No. 76

402
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:12,590
colluding with the rebels

403
00:28:13,510 --> 00:28:15,200
can we directly threaten him.

404
00:28:22,680 --> 00:28:24,240
Any clues on the killer

405
00:28:24,480 --> 00:28:26,210
who escaped from the platform?

406
00:28:26,680 --> 00:28:27,160
No.

407
00:28:32,200 --> 00:28:33,860
Remember that photographer?

408
00:28:35,830 --> 00:28:36,760
Can you find him?

409
00:28:39,790 --> 00:28:40,720
Get up.

410
00:28:43,070 --> 00:28:44,160
Who let you in?

411
00:28:44,160 --> 00:28:45,160
How did you get in?

412
00:28:45,350 --> 00:28:46,640
This is my sister's house.

413
00:28:46,640 --> 00:28:47,790
I can enter whichever room

414
00:28:47,790 --> 00:28:49,200
I want.

415
00:28:49,960 --> 00:28:52,020
Who allowed you to touch things here?

416
00:28:53,480 --> 00:28:54,640
Move away.

417
00:28:56,070 --> 00:28:58,110
Didn't you say you went to fix the camera?

418
00:28:58,110 --> 00:28:59,590
Why did you develop photos instead?

419
00:28:59,590 --> 00:29:01,240
Still thinking about your master?

420
00:29:01,240 --> 00:29:02,310
He's not my master.

421
00:29:03,960 --> 00:29:05,350
Then why didn't you develop

422
00:29:05,350 --> 00:29:06,590
my birthday photos

423
00:29:06,830 --> 00:29:07,890
taken on the train?

424
00:29:08,830 --> 00:29:11,680
We need to wait until the camera is fixed.

425
00:29:11,960 --> 00:29:13,550
When will the camera be fixed?

426
00:29:13,550 --> 00:29:14,610
Just one step away.

427
00:29:14,640 --> 00:29:15,440
What step?

428
00:29:15,880 --> 00:29:16,510
Money.

429
00:29:20,750 --> 00:29:22,400
Can you lend me some money?

430
00:29:24,920 --> 00:29:25,720
For what?

431
00:29:26,310 --> 00:29:27,910
I want to open a photo studio.

432
00:29:29,310 --> 00:29:30,510
You want to open a shop

433
00:29:30,510 --> 00:29:31,640
just to fix a camera?

434
00:29:32,430 --> 00:29:33,830
My... my dream has always been

435
00:29:33,830 --> 00:29:35,270
to open a photo studio.

436
00:29:36,240 --> 00:29:38,070
I think your dream is great,

437
00:29:38,350 --> 00:29:39,830
but I'm afraid it won't come true.

438
00:29:39,830 --> 00:29:40,480
Why?

439
00:29:41,640 --> 00:29:43,570
Because I won't lend you the money.

440
00:29:44,160 --> 00:29:45,000
Fine, don't.

441
00:29:47,070 --> 00:29:48,720
They say borrowers should be humble.

442
00:29:48,720 --> 00:29:50,150
Why are you acting so arrogant?

443
00:29:50,150 --> 00:29:51,750
Is this how you borrow money?

444
00:29:52,240 --> 00:29:53,640
If you lend me the money,

445
00:29:54,480 --> 00:29:55,510
for the rest of my life,

446
00:29:55,510 --> 00:29:56,590
you'll be my sister.

447
00:29:56,590 --> 00:29:57,690
I promise I'll pay you back.

448
00:29:57,690 --> 00:29:59,920
-Really.
-Stop it. I don't want to be your sister.

449
00:29:59,920 --> 00:30:01,000
Unless you beg me.

450
00:30:02,200 --> 00:30:03,660
I shouldn't have told you.

451
00:30:06,270 --> 00:30:07,400
How much do you want?

452
00:30:11,160 --> 00:30:13,420
When I was developing photos yesterday,

453
00:30:13,420 --> 00:30:14,790
I talked to the boss.

454
00:30:15,880 --> 00:30:17,900
He can transfer the shop to us for 5,000.

455
00:30:17,900 --> 00:30:18,710
That much?

456
00:30:18,800 --> 00:30:21,580
[Smile Photo Studio]

457
00:30:19,240 --> 00:30:20,830
The transfer fee is 5,000.

458
00:30:21,000 --> 00:30:21,750
As for the rent,

459
00:30:21,750 --> 00:30:23,640
you pay it yourselves every month, okay?

460
00:30:23,640 --> 00:30:24,840
Is that fine with you?

461
00:30:25,240 --> 00:30:25,960
Sir.

462
00:30:26,240 --> 00:30:27,830
The 5,000 transfer fee you mentioned

463
00:30:27,830 --> 00:30:29,090
is indeed reasonable.

464
00:30:29,240 --> 00:30:31,270
But we don't have that much money
right now.

465
00:30:31,270 --> 00:30:32,550
Here's what I'm thinking.

466
00:30:32,550 --> 00:30:34,180
We pay you a 500 deposit first,

467
00:30:34,180 --> 00:30:35,070
open the shop,

468
00:30:35,110 --> 00:30:36,920
and then slowly pay you the rest.

469
00:30:36,920 --> 00:30:37,780
What do you say?

470
00:30:40,350 --> 00:30:41,750
Then I might as well
just give it to you for free.

471
00:30:41,750 --> 00:30:42,920
That wouldn't be appropriate, would it?

472
00:30:42,920 --> 00:30:43,830
Shut up.

473
00:30:46,000 --> 00:30:46,880
Little brat.

474
00:30:47,350 --> 00:30:49,000
You don't know the market in Shanghai.

475
00:30:49,000 --> 00:30:50,200
Why open a shop if you have no money?

476
00:30:50,200 --> 00:30:51,830
Who are you calling a little brat?

477
00:30:51,830 --> 00:30:52,590
How could you hit me?

478
00:30:52,590 --> 00:30:53,900
Come on! Don't get physical!

479
00:30:53,900 --> 00:30:55,350
-Harmony brings wealth!
-Calm down!

480
00:30:55,350 --> 00:30:56,160
Let me go!

481
00:30:56,480 --> 00:30:57,480
How did it go?

482
00:30:57,640 --> 00:30:58,970
The 5,000 transfer fee,

483
00:30:59,110 --> 00:31:00,680
plus the monthly rent,

484
00:31:00,830 --> 00:31:01,880
is a lot of money.

485
00:31:02,200 --> 00:31:03,240
That's a rip-off.

486
00:31:04,110 --> 00:31:05,160
Mr. Wang.

487
00:31:05,510 --> 00:31:07,590
They are my own brother and sister.

488
00:31:09,030 --> 00:31:10,380
We've been neighbors for so long.

489
00:31:10,380 --> 00:31:11,990
I know everything

490
00:31:12,110 --> 00:31:13,840
about the market on this street

491
00:31:13,920 --> 00:31:15,650
and how your business is doing.

492
00:31:15,790 --> 00:31:16,510
How about this?

493
00:31:16,510 --> 00:31:18,110
Can you lower the price a bit?

494
00:31:20,720 --> 00:31:21,830
Give me a number.

495
00:31:22,310 --> 00:31:23,270
3,000, okay?

496
00:31:24,880 --> 00:31:25,920
Come on.

497
00:31:26,070 --> 00:31:27,720
Your name isn't worth 2,000 yuan.

498
00:31:27,720 --> 00:31:29,440
All these years,
I've given you plenty of discounts

499
00:31:29,440 --> 00:31:31,170
when you've come to Fairy Bath.

500
00:31:32,350 --> 00:31:33,410
Alright, alright.

501
00:31:33,550 --> 00:31:34,960
I'll take off 500.

502
00:31:35,200 --> 00:31:37,310
4,500. Not a penny less.

503
00:31:38,590 --> 00:31:39,720
How much do you have?

504
00:31:44,890 --> 00:31:45,610
2,000.

505
00:31:48,350 --> 00:31:49,840
4,000, final offer.

506
00:31:56,030 --> 00:31:56,750
4,200.

507
00:32:02,650 --> 00:32:05,440
[NBIS Hurricane Team]

508
00:32:05,500 --> 00:32:07,910
All they do is gossip about me.

509
00:32:18,960 --> 00:32:20,380
The Project Slumber film you sent

510
00:32:20,380 --> 00:32:21,620
has been developed.

511
00:32:20,760 --> 00:32:24,180
[Guan Yongshan,
Chief of NBIS Intelligence Division]

512
00:32:21,960 --> 00:32:24,310
But the contents are all encrypted.

513
00:32:25,070 --> 00:32:26,400
You need to find someone

514
00:32:26,640 --> 00:32:28,970
who can crack the code
as soon as possible.

515
00:32:31,260 --> 00:32:38,330
[Fulai Photo Studio]

516
00:32:52,070 --> 00:32:53,270
Wait for Su Causeway.

517
00:33:18,200 --> 00:33:19,030
Welcome.

518
00:33:22,880 --> 00:33:23,960
What brings you here?

519
00:33:23,960 --> 00:33:26,360
Did you take a lot of photos
at the platform?

520
00:33:26,680 --> 00:33:28,840
I... I just took them casually.

521
00:33:29,240 --> 00:33:29,960
Hand them over.

522
00:33:29,960 --> 00:33:30,750
They haven't been developed yet.

523
00:33:30,750 --> 00:33:31,750
Develop them now.

524
00:33:32,000 --> 00:33:33,800
I haven't finished the roll yet.

525
00:34:10,360 --> 00:34:11,480
Are you hurt?

526
00:34:11,920 --> 00:34:13,070
We didn't get physical.

527
00:34:13,070 --> 00:34:15,270
She just asked me to develop the photos.

528
00:34:21,630 --> 00:34:23,360
Your photos are that valuable?

529
00:34:24,030 --> 00:34:25,489
What exactly did you take?

530
00:34:28,280 --> 00:34:29,190
Do you know him?

531
00:34:30,489 --> 00:34:33,989
[Hua Liang, Detective of
the French Concession Police Department]

532
00:34:36,000 --> 00:34:37,330
Can you help me find him?

533
00:34:39,110 --> 00:34:40,909
When it comes to finding people,

534
00:34:41,070 --> 00:34:42,800
No. 76 is better at it, right?

535
00:34:46,190 --> 00:34:47,850
But I trust my old friend more.

536
00:34:51,880 --> 00:34:53,810
Can you buy me a pack of cigarettes?

537
00:35:12,510 --> 00:35:13,590
I'll give it a try.

538
00:36:03,560 --> 00:36:08,300
[Shen Kexi, underground CPC member]

539
00:36:35,440 --> 00:36:36,750
Su Causeway has awoken.

540
00:36:36,750 --> 00:36:38,750
Fulai Photo Studio, Broken Bridge.

541
00:36:41,230 --> 00:36:42,070
Chen Kailai.

542
00:36:43,100 --> 00:36:45,860
Have there been any customers
in the shop these past two days?

543
00:36:45,860 --> 00:36:47,840
Except for the tigress
who developed photos,

544
00:36:47,840 --> 00:36:48,800
there was no one.

545
00:36:51,440 --> 00:36:52,900
I'll introduce you to one.

546
00:36:53,580 --> 00:36:54,750
The son of the match factory director.

547
00:36:54,290 --> 00:36:58,000
[Young Master Feng,
son of the match factory director]

548
00:36:54,920 --> 00:36:57,180
I didn't spend my time at MGM for nothing.

549
00:36:57,670 --> 00:36:59,510
Young Master Feng, this is my assistant.

550
00:36:59,510 --> 00:37:01,110
Photographer, Chen Kailai.

551
00:37:01,450 --> 00:37:03,360
Take a set of photos
for Young Master Feng.

552
00:37:03,360 --> 00:37:04,070
Is it convenient?

553
00:37:04,070 --> 00:37:04,800
Of course.

554
00:37:05,160 --> 00:37:07,160
Jinbao's friends don't need to pay.

555
00:37:07,320 --> 00:37:08,400
I still have to pay.

556
00:37:09,320 --> 00:37:10,580
If you like the photos,

557
00:37:10,670 --> 00:37:12,330
recommend us to your friends.

558
00:37:12,400 --> 00:37:14,510
Relying only on friends' introductions
isn't enough for a new shop.

559
00:37:14,510 --> 00:37:16,640
It's best to put an ad in the newspaper.

560
00:37:18,030 --> 00:37:19,400
If we put it in the newspaper,

561
00:37:19,400 --> 00:37:20,670
many people will see it, right?

562
00:37:20,670 --> 00:37:21,330
Naturally.

563
00:37:22,070 --> 00:37:23,730
Then let's do some promotion.

564
00:37:24,840 --> 00:37:26,440
No, we don't have the budget.

565
00:37:27,070 --> 00:37:28,320
Are you going to take the photos or not?

566
00:37:28,320 --> 00:37:29,210
You talk so much,

567
00:37:29,210 --> 00:37:30,630
and now you want me to spend money?

568
00:37:30,630 --> 00:37:31,710
You don't need to spend money.

569
00:37:31,710 --> 00:37:32,800
I can handle this.

570
00:37:33,590 --> 00:37:34,650
Fulai Photo Studio

571
00:37:34,800 --> 00:37:36,730
will be in the newspaper tomorrow.

572
00:37:38,110 --> 00:37:40,460
[Newsstand]

573
00:37:45,880 --> 00:37:47,110
Newspapers!

574
00:37:47,320 --> 00:37:48,550
Newspapers!

575
00:37:49,190 --> 00:37:50,440
Newspapers!

576
00:38:03,630 --> 00:38:04,880
Newspapers!

577
00:38:05,150 --> 00:38:06,400
Newspapers!

578
00:38:07,840 --> 00:38:08,840
Newspapers!

579
00:38:08,460 --> 00:38:12,190
[Fulai Photo Studio Grand Opening]

580
00:39:10,800 --> 00:39:13,530
Excuse me,
is this the newly opened photo studio?

581
00:39:13,860 --> 00:39:14,380
Yes.

582
00:39:16,290 --> 00:39:17,820
Are you here to take photos?

583
00:39:19,230 --> 00:39:20,030
Let me.

584
00:39:20,920 --> 00:39:21,550
Thank you.

585
00:39:24,550 --> 00:39:27,150
Did you come because of the ad?

586
00:39:33,800 --> 00:39:35,260
Is this your photo studio?

587
00:39:35,840 --> 00:39:36,480
Yes.

588
00:39:36,980 --> 00:39:38,640
I opened it with someone else.

589
00:39:40,530 --> 00:39:41,360
That's really nice.

590
00:39:41,360 --> 00:39:41,960
Thank you.

591
00:39:45,720 --> 00:39:47,920
Is that camera American-made?

592
00:39:49,230 --> 00:39:50,480
It's German-made.

593
00:39:52,030 --> 00:39:54,480
I heard they have color film now.

594
00:39:55,230 --> 00:39:56,110
There is.

595
00:39:56,880 --> 00:39:58,760
But mine is black and white.

596
00:40:04,670 --> 00:40:06,190
Do we know each other?

597
00:40:11,280 --> 00:40:12,760
You've got the wrong person.

598
00:40:12,760 --> 00:40:13,550
Really?

599
00:40:14,510 --> 00:40:16,710
I just feel like you look very familiar.

600
00:40:18,960 --> 00:40:19,960
Exactly.

601
00:40:21,190 --> 00:40:22,850
I think you look familiar too.

602
00:40:26,530 --> 00:40:27,550
I know.

603
00:40:28,480 --> 00:40:29,960
Are you a movie star?

604
00:40:31,480 --> 00:40:32,190
I'm not.

605
00:40:34,030 --> 00:40:35,510
You must be a movie star.

606
00:40:35,960 --> 00:40:37,630
That's not what I meant by familiar.

607
00:40:37,630 --> 00:40:39,150
Why did you pinch me?

608
00:40:39,440 --> 00:40:40,590
You're so pretty.

609
00:40:40,630 --> 00:40:42,430
It'd be a pity not to take a photo.

610
00:40:42,760 --> 00:40:43,550
How about this?

611
00:40:43,550 --> 00:40:45,480
Since we just opened,
I'll give you a 20% discount.

612
00:40:45,480 --> 00:40:46,210
Go get ready.

613
00:40:47,280 --> 00:40:47,960
No, thanks.

614
00:40:48,800 --> 00:40:50,330
Then, final price: 50% off.

615
00:40:50,550 --> 00:40:51,880
If you think the photo looks good,

616
00:40:51,880 --> 00:40:52,940
you can take a copy.

617
00:40:53,200 --> 00:40:54,150
As for the other copy,

618
00:40:54,150 --> 00:40:55,630
we'll put it in the window.

619
00:40:55,960 --> 00:40:57,670
Then all the customers will think

620
00:40:57,670 --> 00:40:59,800
a big star took a photo here.

621
00:40:59,800 --> 00:41:01,150
Aren't you forcing her into the deal?

622
00:41:01,150 --> 00:41:02,150
Don't interrupt.

623
00:41:02,630 --> 00:41:03,810
You must be the boss's wife.

624
00:41:03,810 --> 00:41:05,810
She's the boss, not the boss's wife.

625
00:41:05,840 --> 00:41:08,030
Chen is our best photographer here.

626
00:41:08,370 --> 00:41:11,030
He'll definitely
take a beautiful photo of you.

627
00:41:11,630 --> 00:41:13,760
The photos in the window are very good.

628
00:41:14,590 --> 00:41:16,320
I just dropped by to take a look.

629
00:41:16,340 --> 00:41:17,480
If I need your service next time,

630
00:41:17,480 --> 00:41:18,190
I'll definitely come.

631
00:41:18,190 --> 00:41:18,800
Okay.

632
00:41:20,190 --> 00:41:21,190
What a pity.

633
00:41:21,620 --> 00:41:23,710
You won't get such a good price next time.

634
00:41:23,710 --> 00:41:24,800
Just take one.

635
00:41:26,710 --> 00:41:27,440
No need.

636
00:41:28,030 --> 00:41:28,670
Thank you.

637
00:41:29,480 --> 00:41:30,510
If you want to take a photo,

638
00:41:30,510 --> 00:41:31,840
you must come here.

639
00:41:31,860 --> 00:41:33,450
Mr. Chen is very skilled.

640
00:41:51,000 --> 00:41:52,060
What are you doing?

641
00:41:52,080 --> 00:41:53,280
Do you fall in love with everyone you see?

642
00:41:53,280 --> 00:41:54,480
Yes, except you.

643
00:42:20,880 --> 00:42:22,520
What can this hold?

644
00:42:22,960 --> 00:42:24,840
All the beauty in the world.

645
00:42:25,030 --> 00:42:26,960
What is all the beauty in the world?

646
00:42:28,000 --> 00:42:28,960
I don't know.

647
00:42:29,510 --> 00:42:31,170
Anyway, it's very beautiful.

648
00:42:32,030 --> 00:42:34,230
But I'll definitely know in the future.

649
00:42:43,000 --> 00:42:44,330
He's not Broken Bridge.

650
00:42:45,020 --> 00:42:46,350
His name is Chen Kailai.

651
00:42:46,930 --> 00:42:47,930
I used to know him.

652
00:42:48,710 --> 00:42:50,150
He's a cousin of mine.

653
00:42:51,770 --> 00:42:53,480
But I'm not sure of his current identity.
